B.ahR=new A.h(12,"\ud83e\udea1","I have an eye but cannot see, and I am useless without my thread. What am I?","needle",B.h,"A tailor keeps a box of them.")
B.ajn=new A.h(13,"\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f","I have a mouth but never eat, and a bed but never sleep. What am I?","river",B.h,"It runs all the way to the sea.")
B.ahS=new A.h(14,"\ud83d\udcd6","I have a spine and hundreds of leaves, but I am no tree. What am I?","book",B.h,"A library is stacked with them.")
B.aia=new A.h(15,"\ud83e\uddc5","I come in layers, and the braver you are with a knife the more you cry. What am I?","onion",B.h,"It goes in almost every curry.")
