B.ajI=new A.h(17,"\ud83d\udd25","Feed me and I grow tall; give me a drink and I die. What am I?","fire",B.h,"Do not touch \u2014 it is hot.")
B.ahm=new A.h(18,"\ud83d\udca8","You cannot see me or catch me, but you can feel me, and I can push a whole ship along. What am I?","wind",B.h,"It fills a sail.")
